# Cursor Project Rules

Read and follow `/AGENTS.md` before modifying this repository.

`AGENTS.md` is the canonical source for:

- engineering behavior;
- architecture boundaries;
- implementation workflow;
- testing requirements;
- security controls;
- documentation requirements;
- definition of done.

Apply these principles:

1. Think before coding.
2. Prefer the simplest sufficient solution.
3. Make surgical changes.
4. Define measurable goals.
5. Verify before completion.
6. Review every changed line.

Tool-specific instructions supplement but do not override `AGENTS.md`.

> Cursor applies this rule file automatically because `alwaysApply: true`.
